## 2. Metocean & Environmental Data Hubs

### **Copernicus Marine Service (CMEMS)**
* **Portal Link:** [marine.copernicus.eu](https://marine.copernicus.eu/)
* **Contents:** High-resolution ocean surface current vectors (`uo`, `vo`), sea surface temperature, and Stokes drift variables.
* **Role in Pipeline:** Provides the dynamic hydrodynamic flow fields required by particle tracking models to simulate how ocean currents displace a surface slick over time.

### **Copernicus Data Space Ecosystem**
* **Portal Link:** [dataspace.copernicus.eu](https://dataspace.copernicus.eu/)
* **Contents:** Direct API access to real-time and historical Sentinel-1 (SAR) and Sentinel-2 (Optical) imagery archives, alongside ERA5 reanalysis wind fields.
* **Role in Pipeline Used For:** Automated nightly ingestion of raw C-band SAR frames when monitoring active regions or testing new slick detections.

