## 5. Reference Implementation Architecture

### **Open-Source Reference: `oil-spill-detection`**
* **GitHub Topic/Repo:** [prago-dev/oil-spill-detection](https://github.com/topics/oil-spill-detection) / Reference implementation patterns.
* **Tech Stack Patterns:** Python, OpenCV, Flask, PostgreSQL, Deep Learning (YOLO/U-Net variants), and web dashboard interfaces.
* **Role in Pipeline:** Serves as an architectural blueprint for connecting deep learning raster inference scripts with backend web frameworks (FastAPI) and spatial databases (PostGIS).
